rp.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2126/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hashi_Corp.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2126/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hashi_Corp.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2126/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hashi_Corp.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2126/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hashi_Corp.jpg","#000000",[51],{"name":19,"slug":20,"headline":21,"logo":52,"transparentLogo":53,"logoBackground":54,"colorFill":49},{"id":23,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":24,"assetUrlXs":25,"assetUrlSm":26,"assetUrlMd":27,"assetUrlLg":28,"assetUrlXl":29,"assetUrlXxl":30},{"id":32,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":33,"assetUrlXs":34,"assetUrlSm":35,"assetUrlMd":36,"assetUrlLg":37,"assetUrlXl":38,"assetUrlXxl":39},{"id":41,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":42,"assetUrlXs":43,"assetUrlSm":44,"assetUrlMd":45,"assetUrlLg":46,"assetUrlXl":47,"assetUrlXxl":48},{"contentTopicImage":56,"name":58,"slug":59},{"id":57,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":8,"assetUrlXs":8,"assetUrlSm":8,"assetUrlMd":8,"assetUrlLg":8,"assetUrlXl":8,"assetUrlXxl":8},"2429","Announcements","announcement",false,"2021-12-09","HashiCorp: The Dawn Of HCP | IVP",{"id":64,"alt":7,"caption":7,"assetUrl":8,"assetUrlXs":8,"assetUrlSm":8,"assetUrlMd":8,"assetUrlLg":8,"assetUrlXl":8,"assetUrlXxl":8},"2524",[66,79,82,94],{"instance":67},{"__typename":68,"heading":8,"image":69},"FullImage",{"id":70,"alt":71,"caption":7,"assetUrl":72,"assetUrlXs":73,"assetUrlSm":74,"assetUrlMd":75,"assetUrlLg":76,"assetUrlXl":77,"assetUrlXxl":78},"792","Hashicorp team clapping with confetti at Nasdaq bell ringing ceremony","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/792/HashiCorp-HPC-IPO-768x512.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/792/xs_HashiCorp-HPC-IPO-768x512.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/792/sm_HashiCorp-HPC-IPO-768x512.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/792/md_HashiCorp-HPC-IPO-768x512.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/792/lg_HashiCorp-HPC-IPO-768x512.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/792/xl_HashiCorp-HPC-IPO-768x512.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/792/xxl_HashiCorp-HPC-IPO-768x512.jpg",{"instance":80},{"__typename":81,"largeHeading":8,"heading":8,"body":8},"TextBlock",{"instance":83},{"__typename":68,"heading":8,"image":84},{"id":85,"alt":86,"caption":7,"assetUrl":87,"assetUrlXs":88,"assetUrlSm":89,"assetUrlMd":90,"assetUrlLg":91,"assetUrlXl":92,"assetUrlXxl":93},"795","Dave McJannet and Tom Loverro","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/795/Dave-McJannet-and-Tom-Loverro-768x432.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/795/xs_Dave-McJannet-and-Tom-Loverro-768x432.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/795/sm_Dave-McJannet-and-Tom-Loverro-768x432.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/795/md_Dave-McJannet-and-Tom-Loverro-768x432.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/795/lg_Dave-McJannet-and-Tom-Loverro-768x432.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/795/xl_Dave-McJannet-and-Tom-Loverro-768x432.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/795/xxl_Dave-McJannet-and-Tom-Loverro-768x432.jpg",{"instance":95},{"__typename":81,"largeHeading":8,"heading":8,"body":96},"As we watched the bright and bold letters “HCP” rise up like the sun on a new day over Times Square outside of Nasdaq today, it felt a fitting symbol for the dawn of the next era for HashiCorp – HCP, the public company and HCP, the product.\r\n\r\nWe’re excited to see where this incredibly talented team and once in a generation company can go in the days and years ahead and have every confidence they will continue to define and power the cloud operating model for small companies and large enterprises alike. We will continue to be with you every step of the way!\r\n\r\n*The comments expressed above are not a statement on HashiCorp’s behalf.*",{"id":98,"assetUrl":8},"561",{"assetUrl":8},[],"hashicorp-the-dawn-of-hcp",[103,126,151],{"fullName":104,"teamSubcategories":105,"slug":112,"image":113,"abbreviatedTitle":122,"focusAreas":123,"emailAddress":124,"bio":125},"Sandy Miller",[106],{"name":107,"slug":108,"teamCategory":109},"All","investors-all",{"name":110,"slug":111},"Investors","investors","sandy-miller",{"id":114,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":115,"assetUrlXs":116,"assetUrlSm":117,"assetUrlMd":118,"assetUrlLg":119,"assetUrlXl":120,"assetUrlXxl":121},"2754","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2754/IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Sandy_Miller.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2754/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Sandy_Miller.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2754/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Sandy_Miller.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2754/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Sandy_Miller.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2754/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Sandy_Miller.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2754/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Sandy_Miller.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2754/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Sandy_Miller.jpg","Advisory Partner","Gaming, Internet, Digital Media","smiller@ivp.com","To say that my career path has been circuitous would be an understatement. I have been a securities lawyer, a management consultant, a tech investment banker, a co-founder of an investment banking firm, and finally, a venture capitalist. United by a focus on technology, each role broadened my skill set, perspective, and network.\r\n\r\nEven with all the zigs and zags, the path looks straight in hindsight—a direct line to IVP. After 35 years of VC and tech investment banking, I’m a partner and sounding board to CEOs, advising on financing, and my personal favorite, exit strategy. I’ve had the pleasure of being personally involved with 100+ IPOs and have served on more than 25 boards.",{"fullName":127,"teamSubcategories":128,"slug":137,"image":138,"abbreviatedTitle":147,"focusAreas":148,"emailAddress":149,"bio":150},"Tom Loverro",[129,133],{"name":130,"slug":131,"teamCategory":132},"Fintech & Crypto","fintech-crypto",{"name":110,"slug":111},{"name":134,"slug":135,"teamCategory":136},"Infrastructure","infrastructure",{"name":110,"slug":111},"tom-loverro",{"id":139,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":140,"assetUrlXs":141,"assetUrlSm":142,"assetUrlMd":143,"assetUrlLg":144,"assetUrlXl":145,"assetUrlXxl":146},"2396","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2396/IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Tom_Loverro.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2396/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Tom_Loverro.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2396/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Tom_Loverro.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2396/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Tom_Loverro.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2396/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Tom_Loverro.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2396/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Tom_Loverro.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2396/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Tom_Loverro.jpg","General Partner","Enterprise Infra, SaaS, Fintech","tom@ivp.com","You can immediately tell when you’re using a product that was created by founders with a clear understanding of the customer's needs and incredible passion. Well-crafted products reveal the founders and creators behind them through their novel and often non-obvious approach to solving a problem and attention to detail in that solution.\r\n\r\nI’m energized by working with product visionaries, so I always knew that I wanted either to be a startup founder or invest alongside founders. After my start in investment banking and early-stage venture, I joined Drobo as head of product marketing—a role that deepened my empathy for founders and operators alike. Together, these experiences revealed that my heart was in venture—where my passion for technology and my passion for people intersect. If I can speak with customers and feel their passion for the product and company I’m evaluating, that gives me an incredible amount of energy and conviction. \r\n\r\nWhile I’m a generalist at heart, I gravitate toward companies with distinct, identifiable technological advantages. I’m compelled by understanding why now—what has shifted or changed in the world that allows this opportunity to exist at this specific moment in time. When that advantage is paired with a striking sense of urgency and determination from the founder, you get the feeling that together you can not only see the future but also shape it.",{"fullName":152,"teamSubcategories":153,"slug":160,"image":161,"abbreviatedTitle":147,"focusAreas":170,"emailAddress":171,"bio":172},"Steve Harrick",[154,158],{"name":155,"slug":156,"teamCategory":157},"Apps","apps",{"name":110,"slug":111},{"name":134,"slug":135,"teamCategory":159},{"name":110,"slug":111},"steve-harrick",{"id":162,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":163,"assetUrlXs":164,"assetUrlSm":165,"assetUrlMd":166,"assetUrlLg":167,"assetUrlXl":168,"assetUrlXxl":169},"2392","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2392/IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Steve_Harrick.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2392/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Steve_Harrick.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2392/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Steve_Harrick.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2392/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Steve_Harrick.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2392/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Steve_Harrick.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2392/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Steve_Harrick.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2392/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Steve_Harrick.jpg","Enterprise Infrastructure, Applications, Security","sharrick@ivp.com","Venture capital is all about applying resources toward technological innovation in a creative, yet pragmatic fashion. While my interest in investing dates back to my college years managing the Yale Student Investment Group, the promise of technology is what led me to venture.\r\n\r\nThink about it: software is infinitely scalable when architected well. It’s written once, then patched, supported and sold globally. That means that the winners in this arena become the most valuable companies in the world, and with that value they have the capacity and the reach to be a positive contributor to society at large.\r\n\r\nAfter 25 years and several cycles, I continue to be energized by working with entrepreneurs breaking new ground, and I’m excited to be able to share what I have learned to further their success. Most often, I help CEOs and management teams identify the areas in which improvement will drive the biggest impact—the specific functions that will truly bolster their business.",{"id":174,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":175,"assetUrlXs":176,"assetUrlSm":177,"assetUrlMd":178,"assetUrlLg":179,"assetUrlXl":180,"assetUrlXxl":181},"791","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/791/Hashicorp.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/791/xs_Hashicorp.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/791/sm_Hashicorp.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/791/md_Hashicorp.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/791/lg_Hashicorp.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/791/xl_Hashicorp.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/791/xxl_Hashicorp.jpg","HashiCorp: The Dawn Of HCP",1790351934685]